    "title": "Free Food Distribution Monday In Moscow - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Evan Ellis ,\n1 days ago The Idaho Foodbank will hold a free food distribution Monday at the Latah County Fairgrounds in Moscow. The distribution will begin at 10 a.m. and continue until the last food box is handed out. Food is free to anyone in need, with distribution limits per vehicle. A variety of foods will be available to help meet families’ needs. Read full article",
